  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Murat
  LastName: "\xC7elik"
  Nickname: The Trader
  Occupation: Travelling Trader
  CharacterDescription: 'Whimsical, slightly goofy, and deeply approachable. He carries himself like a classic bazaar merchant who has seen a thousand wonders and just wants to share a good story. '
  CharacterArc: Even as the world decays, he maintains a twinkly-eyed optimism, treating the apocalypse like a strange, foggy detour in a very long journey.
  DateOfBirth: 07/07/1959
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 12 DEC
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
